  "notes": [
    "B1F has two adjacent event tiles per upward ladder; both return to the same 1F warp. They represent one ladder, not separate connections.",
    "Image pixel anchors were visually matched to the six ladder sprites and cross-checked against game-coordinate quadrant/order. They are not an assumed direct projection of game coordinates.",
    "The original PNGs, including credits, are unchanged. Letter markers are HTML overlays, also present in the full-size viewer.",
    "Lettered pairs describe connections only. Ledges, water and story requirements still determine which paths within each floor are usable."
